.TH ASTRAGAL 1 "2026-08-31" "Astragal 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
astragal \- open or control the Astragal terminal app
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B astragal
.RI [ command ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Launches the Astragal macOS application bundle found relative to this script.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B small
Open or activate Astragal.
If external IPC is unavailable, this opens the app normally.
.TP
.B hide
Hide Astragal if it is running.
.TP
.B help
Show command usage.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show command usage.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I src-tauri/target/release/bundle/macos/Astragal.app
Default application bundle path.
